    stat.setString(1, "Tolkien");
    try (ResultSet rs = stat.executeQuery()) {
        while (rs.next()) {
            System.out.println(rs.getString(1));
        }
    }
} catch (SQLException e) {
    System.err.println("query failed: " + e.getMessage());
}
```
Each next advances before any getter reads.

Execute the update then open the generated key cursor:
